Text_en:
1- These few days of forced vacation became a good opportunity to propose 
@aliaalei
 I will sit down and translate the new FIFA disciplinary code. Now, leaving aside the difficulty of the work, I must say that I was surprised from the very beginning why the federation itself has not published such an important text in Farsi.
